{"id":"vod_sn_38432","vodId":"38432","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"关于我被绑架到大小姐学校当庶民样本这件事","name_cn":"关于我被绑架到大小姐学校当庶民样本这件事","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3a7c0b740cfc4acde749f43bdcaa255f.jpg"},"summary":"在清华女子学校里就读的皆是出身名门的千金大小姐，为了以后能够顺利进入社会，学校需要一位“庶民”来教会这些不食人间烟火的大小姐们这个社会的生存规则。平凡的高中男生神乐坂公人（田丸笃志 配音）被选中成为庶民样本，被迫入读了清华女校，成为了校园中唯一存在的雄性生物。　　个性傲娇内向却意外单纯的天空桥爱佳（芹泽优 配音）、成熟善良温柔稳重的金发美少女有栖川丽子（立花理香 配音）、超高智商和超级天然呆属性并存的汐留白亚（桑原由气 配音）、出生武术世家的神领可怜（森永千才 配音），当这些高贵的大小姐们接二连三的出现在公人的身边时，会发生怎样有趣的故事呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":18,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/emzxZzBu2H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GmRNKSheM01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NZhR56fhHL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JA0AbbBm911/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BH2sRzqPXF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xV1zjCFdss1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G3dkVikF041/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VqCfxf83nC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XDYyYgV2hA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/atYLDN9nmY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YZy8E1BzYc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3jvFj0gj2W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yeNV8vZuvY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kbjHLe8NFe1/video/index.m3u